      "side": 1,
      "message": "Done. But given that there is a [plugin](https://source.corp.google.com/h/googleplex-android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:device/google/cuttlefish/build/cvd-host-package.go;l\u003d64) that embeds `PackagingBase`, I\u0027d have to submit this change in internal first.",
